cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Latent Machines, please cite it as below."
title: "Latent Machines: neural models as programmable machines"
abstract: >-
  Research into programs compiled into neural network weights, persistent
  memory, and learned control over exact execution. Each experiment steps an
  exact reference machine and a neural tensor implementation side by side and
  records every disagreement.
authors:
  - family-names: Galego
    given-names: João
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/JGalego/latent-machines"
url: "https://jgalego.github.io/latent-machines/"
type: software
keywords:
  - compiled transformer
  - linear attention
  - Gated DeltaNet
  - delta rule
  - exact execution
  - conformance testing
